{"bankId":"B-SRC-20-1343","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0008","constructFamily":"right_angle_complement","plannedLevel":2,"question":"Satu sudut tegak 90° dibahagi kepada dua sudut. Jika satu daripadanya 32°, berapakah sudut yang satu lagi?","options":["32°","58°","48°","68°"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah dua sudut = 90°.","Sudut satu lagi = 90° − 32° = 58°."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-20-1344","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0009","constructFamily":"coordinate_right_then_left","plannedLevel":2,"question":"Titik Q bermula pada (3,7). Q bergerak 9 unit ke kanan dan kemudian 4 unit ke kiri. Apakah koordinat akhirnya?","options":["(7,8)","(8,3)","(8,7)","(12,7)"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Pergerakan bersih = 9 − 4 = 5 unit ke kanan.","x baharu = 3 + 5 = 8, y kekal 7.","Koordinat akhir = (8,7)."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-21-1413","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0008","constructFamily":"right_triangle_third_angle","plannedLevel":2,"question":"Sebuah segi tiga mempunyai satu sudut tegak 90° dan satu lagi sudut 37°. Berapakah sudut ketiga?","options":["37°","43°","63°","53°"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah sudut segi tiga = 180°.","Sudut ketiga = 180° − 90° − 37° = 53°."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-22-1471","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0010","constructFamily":"ceiling_division_minimum_boxes","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebanyak 137 buku hendak dimasukkan ke dalam kotak yang boleh memuatkan paling banyak 12 buku setiap satu. Berapakah bilangan minimum kotak yang diperlukan?","options":["12 kotak","11 kotak","13 kotak","17 kotak"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["11 kotak memuatkan 11 × 12 = 132 buku, masih berbaki 5 buku.","Jadi satu kotak tambahan diperlukan.","Minimum = 12 kotak."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-22-1472","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0011","constructFamily":"fraction_bar_add_shaded_parts","plannedLevel":2,"question":"Rajah menunjukkan 3 daripada 8 bahagian sama besar berlorek. Jika 2 bahagian lagi dilorek, apakah pecahan yang berlorek?","options":["3/8","5/8","4/8","6/8"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Bahagian berlorek baharu = 3 + 2 = 5.","Jumlah bahagian kekal 8.","Pecahan berlorek = 5/8."],"visual":{"kind":"fraction_bar","parts":8,"selected":3}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-22-1474","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0012","constructFamily":"reverse_percentage_after_decrease","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Selepas dikurangkan 25%, suatu nombor menjadi 90. Apakah nombor asal?","options":["67.5","112.5","120","135"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Selepas pengurangan 25%, baki ialah 75% daripada nombor asal.","90 ÷ 0.75 = 120."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-22-1475","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0013","constructFamily":"ratio_equal_after_addition","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Nisbah bilangan pen merah kepada pen biru ialah 3:5. Selepas 4 pen merah ditambah, bilangan merah menjadi sama dengan bilangan biru. Berapakah bilangan pen biru pada asalnya?","options":["6","8","12","10"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Ambil merah = 3k dan biru = 5k.","3k + 4 = 5k, jadi 2k = 4 dan k = 2.","Pen biru asal = 5 × 2 = 10."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-22-1476","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0014","constructFamily":"target_mean_add_sixth_value","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah data menunjukkan lima nilai 22, 18, 27, 19 dan 24. Apakah nilai keenam yang perlu ditambah supaya purata enam nilai menjadi 23?","options":["28","24","26","30"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah lima nilai = 110.","Jumlah yang diperlukan = 23 × 6 = 138.","Nilai keenam = 138 − 110 = 28."],"visual":{"kind":"five_value_data","values":[22,18,27,19,24]}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-22-1477","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0015","constructFamily":"joined_rectangles_shared_side_perimeter","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Dua segi empat tepat yang sama, masing-masing 8 cm × 5 cm, dicantum sepanjang satu sisi 5 cm. Berapakah perimeter bentuk gabungan?","options":["36 cm","42 cm","52 cm","62 cm"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Perimeter dua bentuk berasingan = 2 × [2(8 + 5)] = 52 cm.","Sisi 5 cm yang dicantum menjadi dalaman pada kedua-dua bentuk, jadi tolak 2 × 5 = 10 cm.","Perimeter gabungan = 42 cm."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-22-1478","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0016","constructFamily":"equal_area_triangle_rectangle","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebuah segi tiga mempunyai tapak 12 cm dan tinggi 8 cm. Luasnya sama dengan sebuah segi empat tepat yang lebarnya 6 cm. Berapakah panjang segi empat tepat?","options":["6 cm","10 cm","8 cm","12 cm"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Luas segi tiga = 1/2 × 12 × 8 = 48 cm².","Panjang × 6 = 48.","Panjang = 8 cm."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-22-1479","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0017","constructFamily":"cuboid_water_depth_increase_from_added_volume","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebuah bekas kuboid mempunyai tapak 20 cm × 10 cm. Sebanyak 600 cm³ air ditambah. Berapakah pertambahan aras air?","options":["2 cm","4 cm","6 cm","3 cm"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Luas tapak = 20 × 10 = 200 cm².","Pertambahan tinggi = isi padu ÷ luas tapak = 600 ÷ 200 = 3 cm."],"visual":{"kind":"cuboid","length_cm":20,"width_cm":10,"height_cm":8}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-22-1480","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0018","constructFamily":"elapsed_time_non_round_minutes","plannedLevel":2,"question":"Satu aktiviti bermula pada 8:47 pagi dan tamat pada 11:16 pagi. Berapakah tempohnya?","options":["2 jam 29 minit","2 jam 19 minit","2 jam 39 minit","3 jam 29 minit"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["8:47 hingga 9:47 = 1 jam.","9:47 hingga 10:47 = 1 jam.","10:47 hingga 11:16 = 29 minit.","Jumlah = 2 jam 29 minit."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-22-1481","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0019","constructFamily":"buy_three_get_one_free_eight_items","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebuah kedai menawarkan promosi “beli 3, percuma 1” untuk buku nota berharga RM5 sebuah. Berapakah bayaran untuk mendapatkan 8 buku nota?","options":["RM25","RM30","RM35","RM40"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Setiap 4 buku, bayaran hanya untuk 3 buku.","8 buku = 2 kumpulan promosi, jadi bayar 6 buku.","Bayaran = 6 × RM5 = RM30."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-22-1482","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0020","constructFamily":"difference_between_mean_and_median","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah data menunjukkan 8, 10, 10, 14 dan 18. Berapakah beza antara min dan median data itu?","options":["1","4","2","6"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Min = (8 + 10 + 10 + 14 + 18) ÷ 5 = 60 ÷ 5 = 12.","Median = 10.","Beza = 12 − 10 = 2."],"visual":{"kind":"five_value_data","values":[8,10,10,14,18]}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-22-1483","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0008","constructFamily":"straight_line_remaining_split_equally","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah menunjukkan satu sudut 128° pada garis lurus. Sudut yang tinggal dibahagi kepada dua sudut sama besar, masing-masing x. Berapakah x?","options":["52°","64°","128°","26°"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Sudut yang tinggal = 180° − 128° = 52°.","52° dibahagi sama rata kepada dua sudut.","x = 26°."],"visual":{"kind":"straight_line_angle","known_angle_deg":128}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-22-1484","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0021","constructFamily":"coordinate_horizontal_distance","plannedLevel":2,"question":"Dua titik A(2,6) dan B(11,6) terletak pada satu garis mengufuk. Berapakah jarak AB dalam unit grid?","options":["9 unit","7 unit","11 unit","13 unit"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Kedua-dua titik mempunyai nilai y yang sama.","Jarak mengufuk = 11 − 2 = 9 unit."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-23-1541","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0010","constructFamily":"divisibility_top_up_equal_groups","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebanyak 156 pelekat hendak dibahagi sama rata kepada 8 murid. Berapakah bilangan minimum pelekat tambahan supaya pembahagian boleh dibuat tanpa baki?","options":["2","4","6","8"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["156 ÷ 8 berbaki 4.","Gandaan 8 selepas 156 ialah 160.","Pelekat tambahan = 160 − 156 = 4."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-23-1542","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0011","constructFamily":"fraction_of_fraction","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Siti menggunakan 2/3 daripada 3/4 meter reben. Berapakah meter reben yang digunakan?","options":["2/7","5/12","1/2","5/6"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["2/3 × 3/4 = 6/12.","6/12 dipermudahkan menjadi 1/2."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-23-1544","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0012","constructFamily":"reverse_attendance_percentage_total","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Seramai 210 murid hadir pada satu program. Bilangan itu ialah 70% daripada semua murid yang sepatutnya hadir. Berapakah jumlah semua murid?","options":["147","280","350","300"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["70% daripada jumlah = 210.","Jumlah = 210 ÷ 0.70 = 300."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-23-1545","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0013","constructFamily":"three_part_ratio_largest_share","plannedLevel":3,"question":"RM360 dibahagikan kepada tiga orang mengikut nisbah 2:3:4. Berapakah bahagian terbesar?","options":["RM160","RM80","RM120","RM180"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah bahagian = 2 + 3 + 4 = 9.","Satu bahagian = RM360 ÷ 9 = RM40.","Bahagian terbesar = 4 × RM40 = RM160."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-23-1546","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0014","constructFamily":"mean_two_equal_unknowns","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Purata empat nombor ialah 18. Dua nombor yang diketahui ialah 12 dan 20, manakala dua nombor lain adalah sama. Berapakah nilai setiap nombor yang sama itu?","options":["16","20","18","22"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah empat nombor = 18 × 4 = 72.","Jumlah dua nombor diketahui = 12 + 20 = 32.","Baki untuk dua nombor sama = 72 − 32 = 40.","Setiap satu = 40 ÷ 2 = 20."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-23-1547","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0015","constructFamily":"fixed_wire_perimeter_reshape_width","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Seutas dawai sepanjang 48 cm dibentuk menjadi segi empat tepat dengan panjang 16 cm. Berapakah lebarnya?","options":["6 cm","12 cm","8 cm","16 cm"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Perimeter = 48 cm, jadi panjang + lebar = 24 cm.","Lebar = 24 − 16 = 8 cm."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-23-1548","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0016","constructFamily":"rectangle_shaded_fraction_area","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah menunjukkan segi empat tepat 18 cm × 12 cm. Jika 1/3 daripada luasnya tidak berlorek, berapakah luas bahagian yang berlorek?","options":["72 cm²","108 cm²","162 cm²","144 cm²"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Luas keseluruhan = 18 × 12 = 216 cm².","Bahagian berlorek = 2/3 daripada keseluruhan.","2/3 × 216 = 144 cm²."],"visual":{"kind":"rectangle","length_cm":18,"width_cm":12}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-23-1549","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0017","constructFamily":"cuboid_volume_decrease_after_length_change","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah menunjukkan kuboid 12 cm × 8 cm × 5 cm. Jika panjangnya dikurangkan kepada 9 cm tanpa mengubah lebar dan tinggi, berapakah pengurangan isi padu?","options":["120 cm³","90 cm³","180 cm³","360 cm³"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Isi padu asal = 12 × 8 × 5 = 480 cm³.","Isi padu baharu = 9 × 8 × 5 = 360 cm³.","Pengurangan = 480 − 360 = 120 cm³."],"visual":{"kind":"cuboid","length_cm":12,"width_cm":8,"height_cm":5}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-23-1550","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0018","constructFamily":"three_sessions_two_breaks_end_time","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Tiga sesi masing-masing berlangsung 35 minit. Terdapat rehat 10 minit antara sesi pertama dan kedua serta antara sesi kedua dan ketiga. Jika program bermula pada 1:20 petang, pada pukul berapakah program tamat?","options":["3:05 petang","3:25 petang","3:15 petang","3:35 petang"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah masa sesi = 3 × 35 = 105 minit.","Jumlah rehat = 2 × 10 = 20 minit.","Jumlah tempoh = 125 minit = 2 jam 5 minit.","1:20 petang + 2 jam 5 minit = 3:25 petang."]}
